{ "Identifier":       {"ImplementerID": "1", "ImplementationID": "PAF-RSR-V1.6-I01", "AIMName": "PAF-RSR-V1.6"},

  "APIProfile":       "Basic",
  "Description":      "Response and Scene Rendering: renders the machine's response as a Speaking Avatar. When a Personal Status is supplied, Personal Status De-multiplexing splits it into a Speech Personal Status and a Face Personal Status that make the speech and face expressive; when the Personal Status is absent the avatar renders neutrally. Text-To-Speech renders the Machine Speech from the Text Object; Generative Face Description produces the Machine Face Descriptors from the Text Object and the Machine Speech. A composite AIM assembled by the Modules that speak; it is a component AIM, not itself a Module.",

